    (r"^(?:what is|what's|what does|meaning of|define)\s+fyi\b|^fyi\b", "**FYI** is an abbreviation for \"for your information\"; it introduces information the reader may find useful."),
    (r"^(?:what is|what's|what does|meaning of|define)\s+asap\b|^asap\b", "**ASAP** is an abbreviation for \"as soon as possible\"."),
