    (r"bird.*symbol.*peace|symbol of peace.*bird|dove", "The **dove** is a symbol of peace."),
    (r"gallbladder", "The gallbladder **stores and concentrates bile**, then releases it into the small intestine."),
    (r"difference between a virus and a bacterium|virus.*bacteri|bacteri.*virus", "**Viruses** are tiny non-cellular parasites that need a host; **bacteria** are single-celled organisms. Antibiotics work on bacteria, not viruses."),
    (r"what is hemoglobin|hemoglobin", "**Hemoglobin** is the iron-containing protein in red blood cells that carries **oxygen**."),
