    (r"what is a catalyst|catalyst", "A **catalyst** speeds up a chemical reaction by lowering activation energy, without being consumed; it is unchanged at the end."),
    (r"difference between a food web and a food chain|food web.*food chain|food chain.*food web", "A **food chain** is a single linear path of energy transfer; a **food web** is a network of many interconnected food chains."),
    (r"hypothalamus", "The hypothalamus regulates **temperature, hunger, thirst, sleep and hormones** to maintain homeostasis."),
    (r"coriolis effect|coriolis", "The Coriolis effect is the apparent **deflection** of moving air, wind and ocean currents caused by **Earth's rotation**."),
    (r"difference between weathering and erosion|weathering.*erosion|erosion.*weathering", "**Weathering** breaks rock down in place; **erosion** transports the broken pieces away."),
