    (r"what is an interface in programming|interface in programming", "An **interface** is a contract specifying which methods a class must implement."),
    (r"what is a variable\b|variable in programming", "A **variable** is a named storage location that holds a value."),
    (r"what is a data type|data type", "A **data type** classifies values, such as integers, floats, strings and booleans."),
